--- !u!114 &1842231437
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1842231435}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 055cb92c0f9213745be6e65d372d2b1d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _facts:
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ea16fa6a6362ebb47be5b3a5c42372d8, type: 3}
    name: Nepal
    fact: "The flag of Nepal is the only national flag that isn\u2019t quadrilateral.
      It consists of two stacked triangles."
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0664f4bba44188f409a2ebfbc5ca0b96, type: 3}
    name: Switzerland
    fact: "The flag of Switzerland is square, not rectangular\u2014shared only with
      the Vatican."
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 160404f0fcda7034e9d7900b9a37540f, type: 3}
    name: Denmark
    fact: "Denmark\u2019s flag (the Dannebrog) is considered the oldest national
      flag still in use, dating back to 1219."
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe9ac607507336149840b3b7bc129364, type: 3}
    name: Bhutan
    fact: The flag of Bhutan features a dragon holding jewels, symbolizing wealth
      and power.
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6ea15b5e98b81aa45849234823020e2c, type: 3}
    name: Cyprus
    fact: The only flag with a map of its own country on it is Cyprus.
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e75a6700ced95e46a7bf287450b6ff5, type: 3}
    name: Philippines
    fact: 'The flag of the Philippines changes its orientation during wartime: the
      red stripe goes on top instead of blue.'
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3ba7f6ce2f51afb4b9fba3ab828e771d, type: 3}
    name: Jamaica
    fact: "Jamaica\u2019s flag is the only national flag without the colors red,
      white, or blue."
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4c6b74fb80763cb4c988e99c864b69d6, type: 3}
    name: Saudi Arabia
    fact: "The flag of Saudi Arabia has the Islamic creed and a sword on it\u2014and
      cannot be flown at half-mast."
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b65ca16db46fb3c4ead515874bf2c8da, type: 3}
    name: United States
    fact: The United States flag has been changed 27 times to accommodate new states.
  - animalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44f8dcb72da77a7439980fd0cd67c1c5, type: 3}
    name: South Africa
    fact: The flag of South Africa was designed to represent unity after apartheid
      and includes six colors, more than most flags.
  _view: {fileID: 731005261}
  _backButton: {fileID: 723179839}
  _timer: {fileID: 746620459}
  _image: {fileID: 86537812}
